    "items": [
      {
        "type": "agentMessage",
        "id": "msg_0984a928e4a4f0df016ad5678aa3348191a95231d3dc70310a",
        "text": "RUN_ID: 01a15197-f4e5-7fc2-8069-4f5112a924b4\nHOST_SESSION_ID: 01a15197-f4e5-7fc2-8069-4f5112a924b4\nALLOWED_INPUT_MANIFEST: specs/ci-model-modernization/verification/T-001/quality-cycle-1/review/invocation.json SHA-256 b617ae4ccc1fcf1dd12a4e570babe6b36aa439a5b2f8f88d9e693f6d1a141d53\nVERDICT: NEEDS_WORK\nFINDINGS:\n- [Major] tests/verification-impact.py:276\u2013284 \u2014 Runtime validation disagrees with the plan schema. An otherwise valid affected plan with reason `force-full` and a recomputed digest passes `validate_plan` without `expected`; contracts/verification-ci-plan.schema.json:358\u2013370 requires `classified-change`. Add enforcement and a standalone negative test; existing reason mutations use whole-record expected equality and miss this gap.\n- [Major] Allowed-input manifest \u2014 No task diff or pre-change source bytes are admitted, preventing the required independent change-scope inspection. `scope-audit.json` provides hashes and unchanged claims, not the implementation diff. Supply a hash-bound task diff or admitted before/after sources.\nCHECKED:\n- Verified invocation identity, task/report binding and receipt chain; independently recomputed the quoted reservation hash successfully.\n- Inspected planner, workflow interpreter, schema and tests line by line against T-001 requirements, acceptance branches and ADR 0037.\n- Inspected saved command output: planner 24 tests, impact 6, catalog 16 and required-checks 18 all passed; lint and typecheck passed. Tests were not rerun under this read-only boundary.\n- Independently compared saved inventories: 415 workload obligations retained, command projections unchanged, no suite/OS losses, one added Ubuntu planner-suite membership; control disposition unchanged.\n- Inspected baseline and rollback evidence: restored hashes match recorded inputs; restored impact/catalog suites passed.\n- Gate limitations: component coverage reports `not-applicable (disabled-legacy)`. No full-repository or hosted execution was independently verified; downstream activation remains outside T-001.",
        "phase": "final_answer",
        "memoryCitation": null,
        "delivery": null,
        "questions": null
      }
    ],
